    <data key="d0">Intellect Design - Fabric Data Service Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AS2JeM2FUzE</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing data ingestion from external sources via ELB into a K8S cluster on EC2, decoupled via Amazon MQ, and using MongoDB Atlas via VPC Peering alongside RDS and Redis.</data>
    <data key="d3">Financial Services &amp; Big Data</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
